entityDescription:
GeoPard is an unbiased cloud-based Analytics Powerhouse for Precision Agriculture. The GeoPard core is capable of processing any set of geospatial data to discover the full potential of ag fields and improve agronomic decisions.
GeoPard services include:
- Automated multi-year (up to 30 years) and in-season field potential zones;
- Accurate and adjustable VRA prescription maps;
- Multi-layer and Cross-layer maps;
- Field and region level satellite monitoring;
- Slope/elevation profile based on remote sensing and machinery datasets;
- Yield, Soil sampling, High-density sensor data analytics;
- Detection of limiting factors, dependencies, changes, stability zones;
- Mobile app with offline capabilities.
GeoPard easily integrates into any system, platform or service.

